---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-24  space-y-24">
    <div class="mx-auto lg:text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm text-transparent uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text">
          Full Marketing Automation for eCommerce and Retail Businesses
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-8 text-white text-2xl xl:text-3xl 2xl:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white">
        Intelligent Workflows with Effective Results for Lightspeed
        </h2>
        <h3 class="font-normal text-xl xl:text-2xl mt-4 text-vulcan-300 ">
          Create AI-powered workflows to enhance user engagement, retention, and acquisition. Grow your store and boost revenue with automated loyalty marketing techniques.
        </br>
        </h3>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative items-center w-full pb-0 mx-auto mt-12 overflow-hidden max-w-7xl lg:p-10 lg:pb-14 "
        style="">
        <img
          class="object-cover w-full -mb-12  rounded-xl border-white/5 lg:rounded-3xl shadow-vulcan-950"
          src="/assets/homepage/Workflow1.png"
          alt="Workflows for lightspeed gift cards and loyalty program"
        />
      </div>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-24 lg:text-left sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12"
        role="list">
         <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="text-2xl font-medium text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 via-indigo-400 to-indigo-500 lg:text-4xl">
              Integrate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
              Easily connect your Lightspeed POS  with top eCommerce platforms and apps, allowing for more tailored workflows. Quickly create effective and smooth customer experiences with just a few clicks.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 via-indigo-400 to-indigo-500 lg:text-4xl">
              Automate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
              Create personalized workflows to launch advanced, data-driven marketing campaigns. Effortlessly integrate features like store credit, coupons, gift cards, and digital wallets into detailed workflows designed to attract, convert, and keep customers.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="text-2xl font-medium text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 via-indigo-400 to-indigo-500 lg:text-4xl">
              Personalize</h3>           
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
              Design fully automated, data-driven marketing campaigns tailored to your customers. Offer personalized incentives based on each customer’s activities and profile, such as rewards, cash backs, loyalty points, coupons, gift cards, and store credits, to enhance engagement and foster loyalty.
          </div>
        </li>
       
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
